      },
      {
        "file": "ventures/sql-migration-lock-check/sql.mjs",
        "issue": "A $ inside an unquoted identifier (PostgreSQL allows a$b$c) was read as the dollar-quote tag $b$; with no closing tag the rest of the file was blanked and a later CREATE INDEX produced no finding. Fixed: a $ right after an identifier character continues the name.",
